- **诚实**：对本对象两条终态（failed/process-interrupted，且 schema 强制其 `resolution_reason_code=invocation-failed-before-resolution`），两侧确实共同断言"模型从未被调用" ✓；对 failed 全集中含 dispatched 失败（backend-error）的过度豁免见建议 S1
